# Obsidian Tag Governance (Mandatory)

## Scope

- Tag operations must run on delta files only (`obsidian_delta.py changed --markdown-only`).
- Avoid full-vault tagging unless the user explicitly asks for it.

## Forbidden Tag Patterns

- Do not create generic tags: `Geral`, `Trabalho`, `areas`.
- Do not create year tags: `19xx`, `20xx`.
- Do not create free-text title words as tags (noise tags).

## Allowed Strategy

- Prefer controlled taxonomy: technology, client, project code, and domain tags.
- In daily notes, infer only from `## Resumo` and `### Tarefas` (ignore tasks widgets).
- Any new tag outside taxonomy requires explicit user approval before applying.

## Reporting

- Every governance execution must provide:
  - `tags_adicionadas_unicas`
  - `tags_removidas_unicas`
  - per-file tag changes summary
